Market Drivers
Growing Preference for Premium Kitchen Surfaces – Homeowners increasingly select quartz for its durability, uniform appearance and low maintenance. Over 60 % of kitchen remodels now incorporate quartz, reflecting a clear shift toward surfaces that minimize long term upkeep while delivering a luxe aesthetic.
Expansion of Mid to High End Residential Construction – New housing starts in the United States, Canada and Western Europe have risen by roughly 11 % year over year, and quartz installations appear in nearly 48 % of these projects. The material’s non porous nature satisfies tightening building codes that favor hygienic finishes in food prep areas.
